{"title":"Coral Snake","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 8 Snake that attacks with corrode (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (0.6% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: venomChance: .6 | venomDamage: 11 | venomDurationMs: 8e3</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-medium\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-medium?lv=8\">Lv 8 <span>16</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-medium?lv=10\">Lv 10 <span>53</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-medium?lv=11\">Lv 11 <span>112</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-medium?lv=12\">Lv 12 <span>71</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/coral-snake-medium?lv=8\" title=\"Pick level 8\"><td><b>8</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>26</td><td>3</td><td>400</td><td class=\"muted\">78 · 4.2 · 1,200</td><td>16</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Orc%20Camp\">Orc Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=